na tadpo asgher-e-jani badi ghareeb haimaa<br>
yaha'n pa doodh na pani badi ghareeb hai maa<br>
<br>
mai kaise dekhu'n tujhe beqaraar jhule me <br>
na dekh uth ke mujhe baar baar jhule me <br>
bus ab to soja mere sheerkhar jhule me <br>
hai muqtasar si kahani badi ghareeb hai maa<br>
<br>
nigaah phool se chehre pa jab bhi jaati hai <br>
lahu ke ashk meri maamta bahaati hai <br>
bujhi na pyaas teri fikr khaaye jaati hai <br>
aseer-e-tashna dahani badi ghareeb hai maa<br>
<br>
fiza ne kardiya apne chaman se door hame <br>
hai koun rakhe jo ranj o mehan se door hame <br>
bala ne gher liya hai watan se door hame <br>
hai waqt-e-marsiyakhwani badi ghareeb hai maa<br>
<br>
ghareeb maa ko ye sadma bohat ziyada hai <br>
yaha'n na sheer mayassar na aab-e-sada hai <br>
mai jaanti hu'n tu yasrab ka shaahzada hai <br>
hai panjetan ki nishaani badi ghareeb hai maa<br>
<br>
tadap rahi hai ye maa teri pyaas ke gham me <br>
hazarou khoon ke khatre hain deedaye nam me <br>
hai hajera ki tarha bebasi ke alam me <br>
hai ismaeel ke saani badi ghareeb hai maa<br>
<br>
gham ek maa ko aye akhtar na dekha jayega <br>
kisi ke khushk labou ka khayaal aayega <br>
hussain ibne ali ko laho rulayega <br>
wo kehna maa ki zubani badi ghareeb hai maa<br>
